{"aliases": ["露娜艾丝", "露娜", "露娜姊", "史黛菈的姐姐"], "body": "# 露娜艾丝：试探、战争条件与公开誓约\n\n她想见识史黛菈带来的男人有多少斤两，因此装作没发现父王企图，同时预备国营广播以备援助。一辉闯入她更衣的房间后，她将他拖入屋内，确认无人察觉再关窗拉帘。\n\n她给一辉出的题目是作为法米利昂代表参加与奎多兰的战争：赢过自己的敌人，而且为法米利昂带来胜利，只有个人获胜不够。两国依联盟条约以魔法骑士代表决斗处理纷争，不动用普通兵器与军队；每五年争夺一次国境天然气田所有权。今年五名代表各比一场，以胜场较多者获胜。\n\n她指出法米利昂最近三十年没有赢过；改变这一局面就能直接贡献国家利益，让包括父王在内的人无法再反对婚约。据约翰转述，她似乎从一个月前便不断亲自交涉，用战争考验一辉是否适合成为史黛菈夫婿；奎多兰国王已准许一辉特别征召参战。\n\n她预先准备的麦克风连接皇都所有广播设备，家庭会议对话通过国营广播传出。她取得席琉斯首肯，又当着国民宣告：国王以战争胜利为前提认可一辉成为史黛菈夫婿，国民表示支持。一辉已接受题目、承诺带来胜利；尚不能写成条件已履行。", "continuity": "novel-main", "evidence": [{"quote": "我本来也想见识一下史黛菈带来的男人有多少斤两，所以才装作没发现父王的企图", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81558, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "他瞒着阿斯特蕾亚和露娜艾丝", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 65618, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000011"}, {"quote": "我原本准备好国营广播要来帮你的", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81666, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "揪紧一辉的衣领，将他拖往房内", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81312, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "确认无人察觉后关上窗户，拉上窗帘", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81409, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "我们和奎多兰即将举行『战争』，一辉，我希望你能参加这场『战争』", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 87756, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "只有你一个人获胜没有任何意义", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88835, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "你必须赢过自己的敌人，并且为法米利昂带来胜利", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88858, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "奎多兰和法米利昂同样都是〈国际魔法骑士联盟加盟国〉", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 87871, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "不动用普通兵器与军队，由两国选出代表国家的〈魔法骑士〉进行决斗", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88030, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "法米利昂与奎多兰当然也是在这项规则下进行战争", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88484, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "我国和奎多兰正在争夺国境附近的天然气田", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88617, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "两国赌上这块天然气田的所有权，每五年举行一次战争", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88645, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "今年是选出五名〈魔法骑士〉代表来进行团体战", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88689, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "总计五场比赛，获胜场数较多的一方获胜", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88727, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "这可是直接贡献国家利益的机会", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88989, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "最近三十年来，法米利昂一次都没有赢得战争", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89024, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "要是你能解决这种窘况，就无人能再对你和史黛菈的婚约表示异议", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89053, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "顽固的父王也一样呢", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89093, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "这次国王──也就是我的父亲允许对方以『特别征召』的形式参加战争", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 92877, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝小姐似乎从一个月前就不断亲自前来交涉──说是想借用这场战争，试试看黑铁这个人适不适合成为史黛菈殿下的夫婿", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 92963, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "事前却准备了一支收音麦克风，连接到皇都所有广播设备", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89994, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "刚才的所有对话全都经由国营广播传到外头去了，这样就能省去麻烦，不需要对国民解释啦", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90060, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝设局取得席琉斯首肯", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89441, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "法米利昂国王席琉斯·法米利昂以取得战争之胜利为前提，承认一辉·黑铁成为第二皇女史黛菈·法米利昂的夫婿", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90261, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "不会有人反对的", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90358, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "当然愿意。既然您希望史黛菈的夫婿达成这项任务，我就必定会为您带来胜利", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89510, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "眼看奎多兰与法米利昂的战争将近", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90936, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "以取得战争之胜利为前提", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90275, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}], "id": "lunaseyes-v10-event", "kind": "event", "known_from": 10, "markdown_sha256": "af81b4f80a41f1cf764a2947740705ee449fca27a4ccbdd88d27b84bdd01a091", "name": "露娜艾丝·法米利昂 / event", "realm": "canon", "source_path": "records/lunaseyes-v10-event.md", "status": "confirmed"}
{"aliases": ["露娜艾丝", "露娜", "露娜姊", "史黛菈的姐姐"], "body": "# 露娜艾丝：说话表现与行为概括\n\n直接可见：她会大笑、称一辉小弟或直接叫一辉，调侃史黛菈是肌肉笨蛋；会说“笨蛋，你在磨蹭什么？”“给我老实点！”等直截了当的命令。正式自我介绍或宣布条件时明确使用第一皇女、下任女王的身份。\n\n行为概括（inference）：从上述对白可把握她直率、会调侃、做事有主见的一面；从预备广播援助、设置胜利条件、取得父王首肯再向国民宣告，可以概括出她会预留援助手段、安排条件并借公开承诺推进事情。这些是对所见行为的归纳，不是对所有场合的绝对性格定论。", "continuity": "novel-main", "evidence": [{"quote": "笨蛋，你在磨蹭什么？在那群家伙发现之前赶快进来", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81240, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "哈哈大笑了起来", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81531, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "很厉害嘛，小弟", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81623, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "喂！不要动！又不是小孩子，给我老实点", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82643, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "难怪能把那个肌肉笨蛋变成娇滴滴的女人", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81639, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "好了，一辉，你说要让我们尽情试探你", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 87498, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "法米利昂皇国下任女王", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81982, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "第一皇女──露娜艾丝·法米利昂", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82001, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "我·第一皇女兼下任女王──露娜艾丝·法米利昂", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88906, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "要是一有万一就出手帮助一辉", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90020, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝设局取得席琉斯首肯", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 89441, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "这样就能省去麻烦，不需要对国民解释啦", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 90082, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}], "id": "lunaseyes-v10-manner", "kind": "character", "known_from": 10, "markdown_sha256": "d5d1380388c908ba38d952a740fedcbd85aa910c85ee54f74a8dade7172ffbfc", "name": "露娜艾丝·法米利昂 / manner", "realm": "canon", "source_path": "records/lunaseyes-v10-manner.md", "status": "inference"}
{"aliases": ["露娜艾丝", "露娜", "露娜姊", "史黛菈的姐姐"], "body": "# 露娜艾丝：身份、外貌与工作\n\n露娜艾丝·法米利昂是史黛菈的姐姐、法米利昂皇国第一皇女、下任女王，尚未继位。家人称她露娜，史黛菈称她露娜姊。父亲是席琉斯，母后是阿斯特蕾亚，妹妹史黛菈是第二皇女。\n\n淡淡的桃色秀发、鲜红双眸，容貌富有知性美；胸部小巧。初次遇见一辉时正在更衣，只穿蕾丝内衣，不能将这一幕当作固定日常装束。\n\n家人已把本次与奎多兰战争的前置工作交给她，作为继位准备。她因此忙于工作，并安排赴奎多兰出差。第十卷未给出确切年龄、身高、发长、惯常发型或常服；未明确其个人伐刀者能力。", "continuity": "novel-main", "evidence": [{"quote": "史黛菈的姊姊──露娜艾丝·法米利昂", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 65023, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000011"}, {"quote": "我正是你女友的姊姊，法米利昂皇国下任女王", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81972, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "第一皇女──露娜艾丝·法米利昂", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82001, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "露娜姊还没来吗", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 64707, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000011"}, {"quote": "露娜还窝在房间里", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 64802, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000011"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝以悬赏令为物证，在众人聚集的餐厅里揭穿父亲·席琉斯的计画", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 83145, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "谁知道？母后，你认为呢？", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 87168, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "史黛菈的母亲·阿斯特蕾亚", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81813, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "我·第一皇女兼下任女王──露娜艾丝·法米利昂就承认你与第二皇女──史黛菈·法米利昂的关系", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88906, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "眼前的女子和阿斯特蕾亚一样，留着一头淡淡的桃色秀发", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81827, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "鲜红色的双眸", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81052, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "那张富含知性美的美丽容貌", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81514, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "女子小巧的双峰包裹在做工细致的蕾丝布料里", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 80848, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "竟然在我更衣的时候闯进房间里", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 81714, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "她的身上还只穿着蕾丝质地的内衣", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82191, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "这次我们将『战争』的前置工作都交给露娜，做为『继位』前的准备，所以她现在很忙啊～她说明天还要去奎多兰出差呢", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 64862, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000011"}], "id": "lunaseyes-v10-profile", "kind": "character", "known_from": 10, "markdown_sha256": "030f5a064d99e428bce90b530d76dd396cfa3499ea99da5e5a0c5d525f3c5933", "name": "露娜艾丝·法米利昂 / profile", "realm": "canon", "source_path": "records/lunaseyes-v10-profile.md", "status": "confirmed"}
{"aliases": ["露娜艾丝", "露娜", "露娜姊", "史黛菈的姐姐"], "body": "# 露娜艾丝：家人与约翰\n\n她不反对史黛菈与一辉交往，却明确说不反对不等于举双手赞成，认可仍有条件。她坚持给一辉的肩伤包扎，比起血弄脏地毯和自己尚未穿好衣服，更先处理伤势；初见的半裸误会由悬赏令澄清。\n\n她以悬赏令揭穿父亲席琉斯驱逐一辉的计划；一辉拥抱、安慰史黛菈而父亲试图干涉时，她喝令父亲跪好，给了他一记后跟踢。\n\n约翰是奎多兰第一王子、下任王位继承人，与露娜艾丝从小一起长大。她大约翰一岁，两人同样就读于剑桥大学；她帮助过其课业与私生活，并曾全力打过他一巴掌。在约翰心目中，她从儿时起便带领着自己，正经、可靠，他很难向她摆出强硬态度。本卷并未说明两人是恋爱关系。", "continuity": "novel-main", "evidence": [{"quote": "露娜艾丝注视一辉左肩上的伤口", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82361, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "地毯被血给", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82482, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "先别管那个，把衣服脱了！我帮你包扎", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82500, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "反正被人看个一、两下也不会死！等一下再穿", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 82708, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝拿出一张纸交给他后，立刻解开了误会", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 83074, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "那张纸就是已经传遍大街小巷，用来通缉一辉的悬赏令", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 83107, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝以悬赏令为物证，在众人聚集的餐厅里揭穿父亲·席琉斯的计画", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 83145, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000014"}, {"quote": "他走向坐在地上大哭的史黛菈，缓缓抱紧她缩成一团的背部", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 85228, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "给我跪好", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 85278, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "席琉斯正打算站起身，露娜艾丝立刻朝他头上来了一记后跟踢", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 85292, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "露娜姊原本就不反对我们交往", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 70853, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000012"}, {"quote": "我是说我不反对，但我也没说举双手赞成", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 87564, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "只要你达成条件", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 88898, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000015"}, {"quote": "奎多兰王国第一王子，兼代表团团长约翰", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 91912, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "他们各自身为两国的下任王位继承人，也是从小一起长大的玩伴", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93736, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "这名大他一岁的女子从儿时就一直带领着自己", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93918, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "两人同样就读于剑桥大学，当时的约翰不知世事，不论是课业或是私生活，正经的露娜艾丝都出手帮了约翰不少忙", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93773, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "露娜艾丝曾经全力给了约翰一记巴掌", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93873, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "我平时已经受到露娜艾丝小姐诸多关照", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93685, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "正经的露娜艾丝", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93806, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "从儿时就一直带领着自己，十分可靠", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93927, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "这是约翰心目中的露娜艾丝", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93952, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}, {"quote": "他怎么也无法对露娜艾丝摆出强硬态度", "source_sha256": "89a78d80d73e11df638468229f12e4ecc378733a6f5e5a2cd4485aaa85bf3074", "start": 93990, "unit_id": "rakudai-v10-common/u000016"}], "id": "lunaseyes-v10-relationship", "kind": "relationship", "known_from": 10, "markdown_sha256": "b187c3157ee1d3de0a945141198eaa20cb5a7c3176dc02d35c31b4690d89ba53", "name": "露娜艾丝·法米利昂 / relationship", "realm": "canon", "source_path": "records/lunaseyes-v10-relationship.md", "status": "confirmed"}
